Error [jet.UnknownField]: Fact read `reflect().range` is compile-time only
  --> tests/ui/fact_read_runtime.jet:4:30
    |
  4 |     print(Severity.reflect().range.start)
    |                              ^^^^^
 Why: A fact is a value known before code generation; it never selects runtime behavior
 Fix: Write `FACT: comptime { Severity.reflect().range }`, then use `FACT` in this expression
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0302
